[00:18.06]1. Young man and young woman,
[00:21.92]do give your heart to me.
[00:25.02]My foe who now taunts me
[00:28.84]will then be made to see.
[00:32.52]Your youth and devotion
[00:35.92]to me you freely give;
[00:40.06]You show all the world
[00:43.20]that for me you really live.
[00:50.34](Chorus)
[00:50.34]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[00:57.30]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[01:04.36]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[01:11.88]And offer praise by your own choice.
[01:32.90]2. Rejoice and take pleasure
[01:35.50]in giving me your all,
[01:38.72]And though you may stumble,
[01:42.40]I’ll raise you if you fall.
[01:45.76]No matter who fails you
[01:49.54]or proves to be untrue,
[01:53.08]Take comfort in knowing
[01:56.56]I’ll always cherish you.
[02:03.16](Chorus)
[02:03.16]Beloved son and precious daughter,
[02:10.16]Be wise and make my heart rejoice,
[02:17.30]That out of your own heart you serve me,
[02:24.82]And offer praise by your own choice.
